  "notes": [
    "The capabilities page and the tolerances page disagree on the drill range (0.15–6.0 mm against 0.2–6.3 mm), the board thickness (0.2–3.2 mm against 0.4–2.4 mm) and the maximum size. Where they differ the stricter value is the limit, and for small drills the other page's value is the recommendation.",
